### 1. 注册用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "age": 25
}

### 2. 登录获取token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. 创建书籍
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/create
Authorization: Bearer {token}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试书籍",
  "description": "这是一本测试书籍",
  "cover_image": "http://example.com/cover.jpg",
  "vip_level": "",
  "price": 0,
  "push_at": "2026-04-13T12:00:00Z"
}

### 4. 创建章节
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chapters/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "book_id": "{book_id}",
  "title": "第一章 测试章节",
  "content": "这是第一章的内容，用于测试章节创建功能。"
}

### 5. 获取章节内容（游客）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chapters/{chapter_id}/guest

### 6. 获取章节内容（认证）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chapters/{chapter_id}
Authorization: Bearer {token}

### 7. 更新章节
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chapters/{chapter_id}
Authorization: Bearer {token}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "第一章 更新后的测试章节",
  "content": "这是更新后的章节内容，用于测试章节更新功能。"
}

### 8. 删除章节（需要管理员权限）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/chapters/{chapter_id}
Authorization: Bearer {admin_token}

### 9. 获取书籍列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/books/list?page=1&size=10

### 10. 获取用户信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/{user_id}
